      "updated": 1786297614208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Campus is basically 30km from anywhere that actually delivers. So if I need groceries, medicine, or even just\nsnacks, it's a 60km round trip - like 5-6 hours and Rs170 in bus fare - for stuff that costs way less than\nthat. Not worth it for one packet of biscuits, so most of us just skip it. Which is fine until it's midnight,\nyou're starving, and there's genuinely no food.",
      "fontSize": 16,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Campus is basically 30km from anywhere that actually delivers. So if I need groceries, medicine, or even just\nsnacks, it's a 60km round trip - like 5-6 hours and Rs170 in bus fare - for stuff that costs way less than\nthat. Not worth it for one packet of biscuits, so most of us just skip it. Which is fine until it's midnight,\nyou're starving, and there's genuinely no food.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 16,
      "index": "a1",
      "autoResize": true
    },
