    },
    {
      "id": "text1016",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 16,
      "y": 306,
      "width": 428,
      "height": 237,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1017,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 52688451,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786297614208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "Kabir, 3rd/4th year, hostel resident (6 of 7 respondents live\nin hostel). Needs quick access to food/medicine/daily\nessentials without losing hours of work or study time.\nBehavior: mostly goes in person or waits on a delivery app\nthat still takes 2+ hrs; when a trip doesn't feel worth it,\njust skips it.\nFrustration: rates the whole process 5/5 on average, weekly.\nReal quotes: \"if there could be any single place from where\ncan get all this and use our time in upskilling\" and \"should\nbe less time consuming.\"\nHow this differs from my proto-persona: I assumed people\nmostly ask friends for help. Real data shows people\nincreasingly try delivery apps first, but those still fail\nthem at the exact moment they need something most - at night.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Kabir, 3rd/4th year, hostel resident (6 of 7 respondents live\nin hostel). Needs quick access to food/medicine/daily\nessentials without losing hours of work or study time.\nBehavior: mostly goes in person or waits on a delivery app\nthat still takes 2+ hrs; when a trip doesn't feel worth it,\njust skips it.\nFrustration: rates the whole process 5/5 on average, weekly.\nReal quotes: \"if there could be any single place from where\ncan get all this and use our time in upskilling\" and \"should\nbe less time consuming.\"\nHow this differs from my proto-persona: I assumed people\nmostly ask friends for help. Real data shows people\nincreasingly try delivery apps first, but those still fail\nthem at the exact moment they need something most - at night.",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 13,
      "index": "a5",
      "autoResize": true
    },
