      "text": "Pull these straight from the User Stories once Phase 1 is\nactually locked. Not brainstorming random features before the\npain point is nailed down - that's solution-jumping and prof\nwill catch it in the viva.\n\nDRAFT LIST (20 items, ready for card sort):\n1. Group Ordering / Split Cart\n2. On-Campus Pickup Point\n3. Request Board (post what you need)\n4. Trip Scheduler (join a town trip)\n5. Volunteer Runner Matching\n6. Delivery ETA Tracker\n7. Nearby Shop Directory & Hours\n8. Campus Health Center Stock Check\n9. Emergency Medicine Locator\n10. Quick-Order Templates\n11. Item Availability Checklist\n12. Cost Splitter / Fee Calculator\n13. Order Notifications\n14. Runner/Fulfiller Ratings\n15. Order History & Reorder\n16. Category Tags\n17. Late-Night Micro-Stock Corner\n18. Time-of-Day Feasibility Check\n19. Payment & Reimbursement Tracker\n20. Group Chat / Coordination Thread",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Pull these straight from the User Stories once Phase 1 is\nactually locked. Not brainstorming random features before the\npain point is nailed down - that's solution-jumping and prof\nwill catch it in the viva.\n\nDRAFT LIST (20 items, ready for card sort):\n1. Group Ordering / Split Cart\n2. On-Campus Pickup Point\n3. Request Board (post what you need)\n4. Trip Scheduler (join a town trip)\n5. Volunteer Runner Matching\n6. Delivery ETA Tracker\n7. Nearby Shop Directory & Hours\n8. Campus Health Center Stock Check\n9. Emergency Medicine Locator\n10. Quick-Order Templates\n11. Item Availability Checklist\n12. Cost Splitter / Fee Calculator\n13. Order Notifications\n14. Runner/Fulfiller Ratings\n15. Order History & Reorder\n16. Category Tags\n17. Late-Night Micro-Stock Corner\n18. Time-of-Day Feasibility Check\n19. Payment & Reimbursement Tracker\n20. Group Chat / Coordination Thread",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 13,
      "index": "aI",
      "autoResize": true
    },
