      "updated": 1786297614208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "5 categories: Getting Essentials, Coordinate, Payments,\nTracking, Emergency. The 13 judgment-call items (especially\nLate-Night Micro-Stock Corner, tied directly to the locked\nPain Point) are exactly what the Tree Test needs to validate\nor break. Real-data tree test form ready to send once V1 is\nfinal.",
