      "text": "Google Form questions (for my 3+\ninterviews)",
      "fontSize": 17,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "Google Form questions (for my 3+\ninterviews)",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 17,
      "index": "aY",
      "autoResize": true
    },
    {
      "id": "text1106",
      "type": "text",
      "x": 1576,
      "y": 306,
      "width": 428,
      "height": 237,
      "angle": 0,
      "strokeColor": "#333333",
      "backgroundColor": "transparent",
      "fillStyle": "solid",
      "strokeWidth": 1,
      "strokeStyle": "solid",
      "roughness": 1,
      "opacity": 100,
      "groupIds": [],
      "frameId": null,
      "roundness": null,
      "seed": 1107,
      "version": 2,
      "versionNonce": 494083235,
      "isDeleted": false,
      "boundElements": [],
      "updated": 1786297614208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "1. What year are you in, hostel or day scholar?\n2. Last time you needed groceries, medicine, or snacks that\ncampus just doesn't have - what happened, what'd you do?\n3. Did you go yourself, ask someone, or just skip it?\n4. If you went into town, how long did the whole thing take\n(travel + shopping)?\n5. What'd it cost you (bus fare + whatever you bought)?\n6. Went alone or with someone? How'd that happen?\n7. Was there a time it was actually urgent and you couldn't\nget it in time? What happened?\n8. 1-5, how annoying is this whole thing for you?\n9. How often does this happen - weekly, monthly, rarely?\n10. (optional) Anything else that sucks about this or that you\nwish worked differently?",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "1. What year are you in, hostel or day scholar?\n2. Last time you needed groceries, medicine, or snacks that\ncampus just doesn't have - what happened, what'd you do?\n3. Did you go yourself, ask someone, or just skip it?\n4. If you went into town, how long did the whole thing take\n(travel + shopping)?\n5. What'd it cost you (bus fare + whatever you bought)?\n6. Went alone or with someone? How'd that happen?\n7. Was there a time it was actually urgent and you couldn't\nget it in time? What happened?\n8. 1-5, how annoying is this whole thing for you?\n9. How often does this happen - weekly, monthly, rarely?\n10. (optional) Anything else that sucks about this or that you\nwish worked differently?",
      "lineHeight": 1.3,
      "baseline": 13,
      "index": "aZ",
      "autoResize": true
    },
