      "updated": 1786297614208,
      "link": null,
      "locked": false,
      "text": "User first, always. Don't jump to solutions in Phase 1-2.\nDon't mix what I actually saw with what I think it means. If\nthe log's sloppy, everything after it is sloppy too. And\napparently answers that sound AI-generated = 0 on\nAuthenticity, so I actually need to know this stuff cold for\nthe viva, not just have it written down.",
      "fontSize": 13,
      "fontFamily": 2,
      "textAlign": "left",
      "verticalAlign": "top",
      "containerId": null,
      "originalText": "User first, always. Don't jump to solutions in Phase 1-2.\nDon't mix what I actually saw with what I think it means. If\nthe log's sloppy, everything after it is sloppy too. And\napparently answers that sound AI-generated = 0 on\nAuthenticity, so I actually need to know this stuff cold for\nthe viva, not just have it written down.",
